<div class="tb" id="t0" style="left:37.79pt;top:617.58pt;width:279.47pt;height:32.3pt;padding:0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;justify-content:flex-start;"><p style="text-align:left;line-height:28.59pt;position:relative;top:0.55pt;"><span style="font-family:'Prelo 2 Semi-Bold';font-size:21.99pt;color:#FFFFFF;">Client Experience  Dashboard</span></p></div>

<div class="tb" id="t1" style="left:31.44pt;top:663.77pt;width:531.96pt;height:124.28pt;padding:0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;justify-content:flex-start;"><p style="text-align:left;line-height:16.78pt;position:relative;top:0.89pt;"><span style="font-family:'Prelo 2 Light';font-size:12.0pt;color:#FFFFFF;">At RSM in Kuwait, our philosophy is built on the power of being understood. Central to this is a genuine understanding of the client experience. Each year, we ask three questions of ourselves: Are our clients satisfied? Is it easy to work with us? Do we continue to earn their trust?</span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:9.79pt;"><br></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height:16.78pt;position:relative;top:0.89pt;"><span style="font-family:'Prelo 2 Light';font-size:12.0pt;color:#FFFFFF;">This report brings together feedback from the year ending {{ end_date }}. It draws on three performance indicators: client satisfaction, likelihood to recommend and ease of working. The findings reflect both what we are doing well and where we can do better. We value the openness of our clients and remain focused on using this feedback to strengthen our collaboration and their overall experience.</span></p></div>

